# Environment variables
# AUDIT FIX: the previous entry was only `.env*.local`, which does NOT match a
# plain `.env` or `.env.production`. A committed `.env` would leak
# GAME_SERVER_PRIVATE_KEY and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY. .env.example is still
# tracked deliberately, so it is re-included after the rule below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

